rary_shelves_iitd.jpg","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en"},"en":{"title":"How to Build a TikTok Creative Library from Real Examples","dek":"A creative library organizes concepts, versions, rights and results."},"readingMinutes":3},{"id":"032","author":"valentine","slug":"format-fatigue","category":"creative","term":"Format fatigue","kind":"essay","image":"format-fatigue","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/format-fatigue.jpg","width":1280,"height":853,"alt":{"en":"A macro photograph of the concentric grooves on a vinyl record."},"credit":"Evan-Amos","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 13066ddb840fd0edc705d1355a26db24f3285fc1.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:12in-LP-Vinyl-Record-Macro-Grooves.jpg","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/"},"en":{"title":"TikTok Content Fatigue: When to Refresh a Recurring Format","dek":"Format fatigue is a hypothesis about weakening response after repetition."},"readingMinutes":3},{"id":"033","author":"valentine","slug":"creative-matrix","category":"creative","term":"Creative Matrix","kind":"guide","image":"creative-matrix","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/creative-matrix.jpg","width":1280,"height":720,"alt":{"en":"Colorful Amsterdam canal houses and illuminated windows reflected in the water at blue hour."},"credit":"Basile Morin","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 552058bafe635df809ac18513f7f7490715e5706.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Colorful_windows_and_canal_houses_at_blue_hour_with_water_reflection_in_Damrak_Amsterdam_Netherlands.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0"},"en":{"title":"Creative Testing Matrix: Lessons from LEGO’s Instagram Reel","dek":"A creative matrix crosses variation dimensions: audience, problem, angle and format."},"readingMinutes":5},{"id":"034","author":"spike","slug":"niche-warming","category":"field-notes","term":"Niche Warming","kind":"guide","image":"niche-warming","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/niche-warming.jpg","width":1280,"height":805,"alt":{"en":"Grapevines spill out through the open roof vents of a small glass greenhouse."},"credit":"W.carter","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 96222187d3e8a19262275212c26ce0a1b42a181e.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Small_greenhouse_with_grapevines_escaping.jpg","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en"},"en":{"title":"TikTok Account Warming: Define a Relevant, Testable Routine","dek":"Niche Warming means exploring niche content in the app through searches, viewing and authentic interactions."},"readingMinutes":3},{"id":"035","author":"spike","slug":"native-posting","category":"field-notes","term":"Native Posting","kind":"guide","image":"native-posting","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/native-posting.jpg","width":1200,"height":1600,"alt":{"en":"A red roadside postbox set against dense green leaves and climbing plants."},"credit":"Rodhullandemu","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: d3e028e667be99e939087a2a5c28148a4c304537.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Post_box_at_81_Coombe_Road,_Irby.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0"},"en":{"title":"Native TikTok Posting: Workflow, Features and Quality Checks","dek":"Native Posting means publishing through a platform’s consumer interface."},"readingMinutes":3},{"id":"036","author":"spike","slug":"native-warming","category":"field-no