ccount to its role, market, owner and observed state."},"readingMinutes":3},{"id":"045","author":"spike","slug":"zero-views","category":"field-notes","term":"Stuck at 0 views","kind":"guide","image":"zero-views","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/zero-views.jpg","width":1280,"height":720,"alt":{"en":"Rows of empty red seats inside a dark cinema auditorium."},"credit":"Eden, Janine and Jim","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 7efa31682b711fa79d7e2cd7453520dc65b0ae27.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Empty_Movie_Theater_(54280927025).jpg","license":"CC BY 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0"},"en":{"title":"Why Does My TikTok Have Zero Views? A Diagnostic Workflow","dek":"Stuck at 0 views describes low or absent distribution after publication."},"readingMinutes":3},{"id":"046","author":"spike","slug":"shadowban","category":"field-notes","term":"Shadowban","kind":"guide","image":"shadowban","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/shadowban.jpg","width":1280,"height":853,"alt":{"en":"Streetlights glow softly through fog above a road in Mecklenburg-Vorpommern."},"credit":"Harald Hoyer","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: c3ff7a3d2c68e70e7bdffd03a4e5488f69f99994.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fog_and_Street_lights_in_Mecklenburg-Vorpommern.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0"},"en":{"title":"TikTok Shadowban or Low Reach? How to Investigate","dek":"Shadowban is an informal term for suspected distribution suppression without explicit notice."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"047","author":"spike","slug":"distribution-failure","category":"field-notes","term":"Distribution failure","kind":"guide","image":"distribution-failure","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/distribution-failure.jpg","width":1280,"height":960,"alt":{"en":"The remnants of an old railway bridge beside a newer crossing in rural South Australia."},"credit":"Calistemon","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 146af285bc7bdad5b630bc77878acb87a5765a00.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Crystal_Brook%E2%80%93Broken_Hill_railway_line_bridge_over_the_Cavanagh_Chase,_July_2026_03.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0"},"en":{"title":"TikTok Publishing Failures: Separate Upload, Access and Reach","dek":"A distribution failure can involve account access, a feature, removed content, a missing publication or weak reach."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"048","author":"spike","slug":"native-not-deceptive","category":"field-notes","term":"Commercial transparency","kind":"guide","image":"native-not-deceptive","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/native-not-deceptive.jpg","width":1252,"height":835,"alt":{"en":"Sunlight illuminates the veins and edges of green guava leaves."},"credit":"מינוזיג","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: b256c11b7a9475c9669c649acaef689be162b219.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Guava_leaves_sunlight.jpg","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en"},"en":{"title":"Organic Brand Accounts: Native Content and Transparent Identity","dek":"Content can be useful, native and commercial at once."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"049","author":"spike","slug":"reddit-agd","category":"field-notes","term":"Reddit AGD","kind":"guide","image":"reddit-agd","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/reddit-agd.jpg","width":1280,"height":940,"alt":{"en":"Rows of shelves and display tables filled with books inside a bookshop."},"credit":"Anthony O'Neil","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 1f536d2bc8d8fba99c8f7f939798567cd3288555.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bookshop_interior_-_geograph.org.uk_-_7540912.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0"},"en":{"title":"Reddit Marketing and AGD: Contribute Before You Promote","dek":"Reddit AGD adapts account differentiation to legitimate community participation."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"050","author":"spike","slug":"community-distribution","category":"field-notes","term":"Community distribution","kind":"guide","image":"community-distribution","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/community-distribution.jpg","width":1280,"height":858,"alt":{"en":"An elevated view of a dense festival crowd gathered beside an illuminated outdoor stage."},"credit":"Skyviewphotography","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: b60dfd243e4db215fc16a2c9912ff30e240ebefa.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Splore_Crowd_2016_.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0"},"en":{"title":"Community Marketing: How Brands Join Existing Conversations","dek":"A community is not merely an acquisition channel."},"readingMinutes":3},{"id":"051","author":"spike","slug":"content-rights","category":"field-notes","term":"Content rights","kind":"guide","image":"content-rights","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/content-rights.jpg","width":1280,"height":588,"alt":{"en":"A row of worn archive binders with handwritten labels and colored spines."},"credit":"MHM55","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: d4710c9b080ac8372ddfa3b81608dd5718cecd0f.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Archive-boxes-Biella-misc.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0"},"en":{"title":"Social Media Content Rights: A Publishing Checklist","dek":"A provenance register connects images, sounds and videos to their origins and checked usage conditions."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"052","author":"spike","slug":"campaign-retrospective","category":"field-notes","term":"Campaign retrospective","kind":"guide","image":"campaign-retrospective","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/campaign-retrospective.jpg","width":1280,"height":843,"alt":{"en":"Film boxes and developing equipment inside a historic photographic darkroom."},"credit":"Geoff Charles","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: c3c5ded9b45880247af2d935e4dac39f5282175e.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Photographic_darkroom,_probably_Geoff_Charles%27s_darkroom,_Bangor_(1532109).jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0"},"en":{"title":"AGD Campaign Review: Creative, Distribution and Evidence","dek":"An AGD retrospective connects objectives, execution, observations and decisions."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"053","author":"spike","slug":"budget-of-learning","category":"field-notes","term":"Learning budget","kind":"guide","image":"budget-of-learning","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/budget-of-learning.jpg","width":1280,"height":960,"alt":{"en":"Two mechanical stopwatches mounted on a panel among historic control tower instruments."},"credit":"Wolfmann","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: c2e1d4fcce6ce0a6aa75abf5c414d1f5a0013fe8.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bardufoss_Lufthavn_Airport_Norway_Avinor_UTSTILLING_teknisk_utstyr_Old_control_tower_technical_equipment_on_display_-_Excelsior_Park_Swiss_made_stopwatches_stoppeklokker_(2022-06-03)_IMG_2286.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0"},"en":{"title":"How to Budget an AGD Experiment: Costs and Learning Goals","dek":"A learning budget includes production, coordination, execution and analysis."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"054","author":"jet","slug":"viral-hit","category":"lab","term":"Viral Hit","kind":"protocol","image":"viral-hit","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/viral-hit.jpg","width":1280,"height":691,"alt":{"en":"A powerful ocean wave bursts into white spray against a rocky shoreline."},"credit":"Ronnie Robertson","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 778899c2be915c2aeae6bf20fe3ab48071988fdf.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Burgi_Wave_Burst_IMG_7243_(16591566349).jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0"},"en":{"title":"What Counts as a Viral TikTok? Define the Comparison","dek":"A Viral Hit is an unusually high distribution outcome relative to a defined baseline: account, cohort or campaign."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"055","author":"jet","slug":"viral-hit-rate","category":"lab","term":"Viral Hit Rate","kind":"protocol","image":"viral-hit-rate","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/viral-hit-rate.jpg","width":1280,"height":854,"alt":{"en":"Raindrops cling to a car window, blurring the parked vehicles outside."},"credit":"Shixart1985","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: b2960be3a0274e5d5f571933bde8e653e6b20033.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Close-up_of_the_rain_drops_on_a_car_window._Car_in_a_blurry_background.jpg","license":"CC BY 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0"},"en":{"title":"TikTok Viral Hit Rate: Define Attempts and Measure Outcomes","dek":"Viral Hit Rate is the proportion of eligible posts exceeding a predefined outlier threshold."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"056","author":"jet","slug":"median-vs-mean","category":"lab","term":"Median vs mean","kind":"protocol","image":"median-vs-mean","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/median-vs-mean.jpg","width":1280,"height":853,"alt":{"en":"Smooth, multicolored pebbles packed together on a beach."},"credit":"Quim Gil","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 87bd342bb93763993e78d946b54b3bf395b1b570.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pebbles_in_Rethymno%27s_beach.jpg","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en"},"en":{"title":"TikTok Analytics: Average vs Median Views Explained","dek":"The mean adds values and divides by their count."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"057","author":"jet","slug":"percentiles","category":"lab","term":"Distribution percentiles","kind":"protocol","image":"percentiles","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/percentiles.jpg","width":1280,"height":853,"alt":{"en":"Layers of mountain ridges fade into blue haze beneath the distant Himalayas."},"credit":"Timothy A. Gonsalves","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 709838554486b27f57f1ad25af603f9799cbbb14.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Shivaliks_Himalayas_Aerial_Dehaze_Himachal_Feb20_R16_02827.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0"},"en":{"title":"Social Media Analytics: How to Read Performance Percentiles","dek":"A percentile locates a value in an ordered distribution."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"058","author":"jet","slug":"power-law","category":"lab","term":"Distribution concentration","kind":"protocol","image":"power-law","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/power-law.jpg","width":1280,"height":720,"alt":{"en":"Lightning illuminates a storm cloud above a harbour pier and lighthouse."},"credit":"Maxime Raynal","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 74ed3615cd6743fb4e031d1d1b58a3fd45de2d23.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Port_and_lighthouse_overnight_storm_with_lightning_in_Port-la-Nouvelle.jpg","license":"CC BY 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0"},"en":{"title":"Why a Few TikTok Posts Can Dominate Your Reach","dek":"Concentration measures the share of outcomes produced by a fraction of posts."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"059","author":"jet","slug":"top-ten-accounts","category":"lab","term":"Account concentration","kind":"protocol","image":"top-ten-accounts","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/top-ten-accounts.jpg","width":1280,"height":832,"alt":{"en":"The illuminated Price Building rises above surrounding rooftops in Quebec City at night."},"credit":"Wilfredor","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 806daa0796b8e1901acf5837aa1c26d99194be81.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Price_Building_illuminated_at_night_in_Quebec_City.jpg","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en"},"en":{"title":"Multi-Account Analytics: Measure Performance Concentration","dek":"Account concentration shows which assets carry the total outcome."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"060","author":"jet","slug":"matched-cohorts","category":"lab","term":"Matched cohorts","kind":"protocol","image":"matched-cohorts","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/matched-cohorts.jpg","width":1280,"height":869,"alt":{"en":"A regular grid of windows covers the facade of the Conjunto Nacional building in São Paulo."},"cred