icenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0"},"en":{"title":"Does TikTok Account Age Affect Reach? What to Compare","dek":"Account age can be associated with history, followers and behavior."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"065","author":"jet","slug":"slideshow-vs-video","category":"lab","term":"Slideshow vs video","kind":"protocol","image":"slideshow-vs-video","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/slideshow-vs-video.jpg","width":1280,"height":853,"alt":{"en":"A strip of 8 mm film curls away from its reel."},"credit":"Coyau","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 5002c79b0b2e3888e3004386bf9c24c987c10f2c.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:8_mm_Kodak_safety_film_reel_06.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0"},"en":{"title":"TikTok Slideshows vs Videos: How to Compare the Formats","dek":"Comparing slideshow and video requires a comparable promise and audience."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"066","author":"jet","slug":"formatted-vs-chaotic","category":"lab","term":"Formatted vs chaotic","kind":"protocol","image":"formatted-vs-chaotic","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/formatted-vs-chaotic.jpg","width":1280,"height":843,"alt":{"en":"An upward view through the sweeping spiral staircase at the Vatican Museums."},"credit":"Colin","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 26b9dc66ea2c1b295e5c1834a652b763214cad24.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Vatican_Museums_Spiral_Staircase_Looking_Up_2012.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0"},"en":{"title":"TikTok Content Strategy: Recurring Series vs Spontaneous Posts","dek":"A Formatted versus Chaotic test compares a recurring structure with multiple formats."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"067","author":"jet","slug":"creative-diversity-test","category":"lab","term":"Creative diversity","kind":"protocol","image":"creative-diversity-test","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/creative-diversity-test.jpg","width":1280,"height":676,"alt":{"en":"Colorful figures and decorative panels in a stained glass cathedral window."},"credit":"Pudelek; retouch by Albertus teolog","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: ab2b78f70b4197eba0649f9c964509668fa28271.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:St_Vitus_Cathedral_-_Stained_glass_(retouch).jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0"},"en":{"title":"TikTok Creative Testing: Compare Ideas, Not Just Edits","dek":"A creative-diversity test examines meaningful variation rather than counting files."},"readingMinutes":3},{"id":"068","author":"jet","slug":"native-features-test","category":"lab","term":"Native features","kind":"protocol","image":"native-features-test","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/native-features-test.jpg","width":1280,"height":824,"alt":{"en":"Camera lenses of different sizes and focal lengths arranged on a shelf."},"credit":"Carlos Valenzuela Montuy","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 64ce48e9dc3b2aa2cc7497d42862acec291b1373.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Photographic_lenses_and_tubes_2025.jpg","license":"CC BY 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0"},"en":{"title":"TikTok Native Features: Test Their Creative Contribution","dek":"A native-feature test separates a feature’s effect from its publishing channel."},"readingMinutes":3},{"id":"069","author":"jet","slug":"zero-view-rate","category":"lab","term":"Zero-view rate","kind":"protocol","image":"zero-view-rate","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/zero-view-rate.jpg","width":1280,"height":853,"alt":{"en":"An empty swimming pool stands beside rubble at a demolished motel."},"credit":"Michael Rivera","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: f4de30510a8975e36ee0c17fdab5f9935d2799bb.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Empty_swimming_pool_in_front_of_demolished_Western_Motel,_Valdosta.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0"},"en":{"title":"How to Measure Your TikTok Zero-View Rate","dek":"Zero-view rate depends on observation age, measurement source and eligibility scope."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"070","author":"jet","slug":"confidence-intervals","category":"lab","term":"Uncertainty","kind":"protocol","image":"confidence-intervals","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/confidence-intervals.jpg","width":1280,"height":853,"alt":{"en":"Mist drifts across a still mountain lake around the silhouette of a small tree."},"credit":"Bernd Thaller","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: abf225ea99a36441f354adb2bc92f24ea474854f.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Receding_Fog_over_Lake_Altaussee.jpg","license":"CC BY 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0"},"en":{"title":"Social Media Experiments: Confidence Intervals Explained","dek":"An interval expresses uncertainty under a method’s assumptions."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"071","author":"jet","slug":"survivorship-bias","category":"lab","term":"Survivorship bias","kind":"protocol","image":"survivorship-bias","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/survivorship-bias.jpg","width":1280,"height":853,"alt":{"en":"The rusted hull of a shipwreck rests in the surf off a sandy beach."},"credit":"Ximonic (Simo Räsänen)","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 06bc209cac48bb2a2a4f1a66a004ae8a68c74102.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wreck_of_Cabo_de_Santa_Maria,_2010_December_-_4.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0"},"en":{"title":"TikTok Case Studies and Survivorship Bias: What Is Missing?","dek":"Survivorship bias appears when analysis retains only still-visible units."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"072","author":"jet","slug":"regression-to-mean","category":"lab","term":"Regression to the mean","kind":"protocol","image":"regression-to-mean","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/regression-to-mean.jpg","width":1170,"height":1600,"alt":{"en":"An ornate antique pendulum clock with a white face and carved gold decoration."},"credit":"Christoph Braun","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: b886568db215861a1a91c3da842925a719a0dd4c.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pendulum_clock_by_Jacob_Kock,_antique_furniture_photography,_IMG_0931_edit.jpg","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en"},"en":{"title":"Why TikTok Views Drop After a Viral Post","dek":"An extreme outcome can be followed by more ordinary outcomes."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"073","author":"jet","slug":"cohort-maturity","category":"lab","term":"Cohort maturity","kind":"protocol","image":"cohort-maturity","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/cohort-maturity.jpg","width":1280,"height":853,"alt":{"en":"A small tomato seedling pushes two green leaves above dry brown soil."},"credit":"Ksheera Piraati","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 4f0a3b5f6801bc6c97e59c31a53e6d0adbc51709.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Young_seedling_of_tomato_emerging_from_