:"experiment-preregistration","category":"lab","term":"Preregistration","kind":"protocol","image":"experiment-preregistration","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/experiment-preregistration.jpg","width":1280,"height":853,"alt":{"en":"Gloved hands write experimental observations in an open laboratory notebook."},"credit":"Katherine Stember","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: ccc145165e1317324120da4f6b9bea5c40079bd7.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lab_Notebook.jpg","license":"CC BY 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0"},"en":{"title":"Social Media Experiment Template: Write the Plan First","dek":"Preregistering means recording an experiment’s question, criteria and planned analysis in advance."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"077","author":"jet","slug":"stop-rules","category":"lab","term":"Stop rules","kind":"protocol","image":"stop-rules","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/stop-rules.jpg","width":1280,"height":853,"alt":{"en":"A rusted railway buffer and heavy bolts beside a moss-covered wooden sleeper."},"credit":"Dietmar Rabich","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: b4d1327c14b2b9518d0812daf4f9dc941fcdf629.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Haltern_am_See,_Sythen,_ehemalige_Bahnstrecke_--_2022_--_9807.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0"},"en":{"title":"When to Stop an AGD Experiment: Budget and Evidence Rules","dek":"A stop rule specifies when to end, pause or reconsider an experiment."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"078","author":"organic-club-editorial","slug":"evidence-ladder","category":"lab","term":"Evidence ladder","kind":"protocol","image":"evidence-ladder","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/evidence-ladder.jpg","width":1080,"height":607,"alt":{"en":"Rough stone steps climb between large rocks and green plants."},"credit":"RedRyan101","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 94a102430cb60ab7c908d2ed9ea3509f3b61f39f.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Stone_stairs.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0"},"en":{"title":"How to Evaluate AGD Claims: Documentation, Examples and Tests","dek":"The AGD evidence ladder separates platform documentation, methodical proprietary data, controlled experiments, repeated observations, hypotheses and folklore."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"079","author":"jet","slug":"ai-agd","category":"machines","term":"AI AGD","kind":"guide","image":"ai-agd","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/ai-agd.jpg","width":1280,"height":853,"alt":{"en":"A vintage mainframe computer with control buttons, reel storage, and cabinets of electronics."},"credit":"Pargon","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 4bca5422b5ac0db97ae1373679890f422c520f25.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mainframe_Computer.jpg","license":"CC BY 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0"},"en":{"title":"AI for AGD Marketing: From Creative Brief to Publishing Workflow","dek":"AI AGD means using AI to plan, produce, analyze or orchestrate AGD."},"readingMinutes":3},{"id":"080","author":"jet","slug":"agentic-agd","category":"machines","term":"Agentic AGD","kind":"guide","image":"agentic-agd","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/agentic-agd.jpg","width":1280,"height":720,"alt":{"en":"Yellow industrial robots handle kegs inside a brewery production area."},"credit":"Larry D. Moore","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 52b376103be