nect AI to Social Operations","dek":"MCP lets an agent client discover and call tools exposed by a server."},"readingMinutes":4},{"id":"083","author":"jet","slug":"dry-run-contract","category":"machines","term":"Dry-run contract","kind":"guide","image":"dry-run-contract","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/dry-run-contract.jpg","width":1280,"height":992,"alt":{"en":"Mary Jackson holds an aircraft model inside a wind tunnel at NASA Langley."},"credit":"NASA; restoration by Adam Cuerden","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 42976da6950d21d2f0ae93640659121b482a3bab.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mary_Jackson_in_a_wind_tunnel_with_a_model_at_NASA_Langley.jpg","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/"},"en":{"title":"What Does a TokPortal Dry Run Do? Preview Scope and Limits","dek":"A dry run validates a request without producing live effects under the service’s contract."},"readingMinutes":3},{"id":"084","author":"jet","slug":"idempotency","category":"machines","term":"Idempotency","kind":"guide","image":"idempotency","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/idempotency.jpg","width":1280,"height":946,"alt":{"en":"Numbered mechanical counter wheels inside an analogue tape deck."},"credit":"Retired electrician","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: e42ad2d38f4e8621abf96d9db7464bdb61b0c686.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Technics_RS-M270x_mechanical_counter.jpg","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en"},"en":{"title":"API Retry Safety: Avoid Duplicate Social Publishing Operations","dek":"Idempotency prevents repeated execution of one intent from producing multiple effects when supported by the operation’s contract."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"085","author":"jet","slug":"webhooks","category":"machines","term":"Webhooks","kind":"guide","image":"webhooks","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/webhooks.jpg","width":1280,"height":853,"alt":{"en":"A vintage telegraph machine and its brass components displayed on a wooden base."},"credit":"Homoatrox","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: e87da8fd61b405505186536d68723e07cd1b94f9.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Telegraph_machine_in_DOSAAF_museum_(Minsk).jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0"},"en":{"title":"Social Publishing Webhooks: Events, Status and Recovery","dek":"A webhook sends an event to your integration."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"086","author":"jet","slug":"agent-budget","category":"machines","term":"Agent budgets","kind":"guide","image":"agent-budget","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/agent-budget.jpg","width":1280,"height":850,"alt":{"en":"A wall covered with electricity meters, junction boxes, and cables in Kolkata."},"credit":"Jorge Royan","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 9fd2f2f167bccd31d986f87d485e162e7cd15e8d.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:India_-_Kolkata_electricity_meters_-_3832.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0"},"en":{"title":"How to Set a Budget for an AI Marketing Agent","dek":"An agent budget defines authorized operations, limits and renewal conditions."},"readingMinutes":3},{"id":"087","author":"jet","slug":"agent-maturity","category":"machines","term":"AGD maturity model","kind":"guide","image":"agent-maturity","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/agent-maturity.jpg","width":1280,"height":3090,"alt":{"en":"A tall metal escape ladder with a protective cage beside a building."},"credit":"Frank C. Müller","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 140892ac870d0b5d45c28cc5b523aa6a5fecfdcf.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fluchtleiter_(fcm).jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0"},"en":{"title":"AI Marketing Automation: When to Increase Agent Autonomy","dek":"The AGD model distinguishes manual work, AI assistance, approved orchestration, agentic management and broader autonomy."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"088","author":"jet","slug":"api-slop","category":"machines","term":"API Slop","kind":"guide","image":"api-slop","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/api-slop.jpg","width":1280,"height":721,"alt":{"en":"A dense tangle of cables running through a service shaft."},"credit":"Dmitry G","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 6391382f4065ce09c9bf83beda2b64ca4092f673.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cable_salad_in_shaft.JPG","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0"},"en":{"title":"Social Media API Automation: Keep the Editorial Brief Intact","dek":"API Slop criticizes mass delivery of undifferentiated content without attention to accounts or context."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"089","author":"jet","slug":"content-routing","category":"machines","term":"Content routing","kind":"guide","image":"content-routing","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/content-routing.jpg","width":1280,"height":814,"alt":{"en":"A red and yellow railway switch lever beside branching tracks."},"credit":"W.carter","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 277cd29bdacbcd6cde447a2c17d6fa9aae9a42ed.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Railway_switch_lever_on_Gr%C3%B6t%C3%B6.jpg","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/"},"en":{"title":"Content Routing for Multiple Social Accounts","dek":"Routing connects creative work to an account by audience, persona, market and purpose."},"readingMinutes":2},{"id":"090","author":"jet","slug":"creative-clustering","category":"machines","term":"Creative clustering","kind":"guide","image":"creative-clustering","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/creative-clustering.jpg","width":1280,"height":851,"alt":{"en":"Small square mosaic tiles form a geometric pattern in warm pink and brown shades."},"credit":"Asturio Cantabrio","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: 20f204ef32026a23142fa474e049e98a441a1058.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mosaic_tile_works_ac_(1).jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0"},"en":{"title":"How to Organize Social Creative by Idea and Mechanism","dek":"Creative clustering groups content under chosen criteria."},"readingMinutes":4},{"id":"091","author":"jet","slug":"anomaly-detection","category":"machines","term":"Anomaly detection","kind":"guide","image":"anomaly-detection","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/anomaly-detection.jpg","width":1280,"height":676,"alt":{"en":"An oscilloscope displays a bright cyan waveform on its screen."},"credit":"Pittigrilli","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: d96ff7da85e43d6db955879d46cdfb25af8152c7.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tektronix_Oscilloscope_475A.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0"},"en":{"title":"Social Media Monitoring: Build Useful Operational Alerts","dek":"Anomaly detection flags deviation from a defined base